ind":"announcement","title":"Someone Gave This Duck a Magic Staff","summary":"The hat. The beard. The staff. This duck looks like it knows exactly what it's doing. The other ducks might disagree. Meet the Wizard Duck! In this devlog, it sends its neighbours floating and spinning through clouds of purple magic. My favourite part is how tiny it looks next to the ducks it's throwing around. All that chaos from something you could fit in your pocket. Here's a closer look at the outfit, followed by a little spellcasting around the pool: Which duck would you trust with a magic ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:56:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030298","verified_at":"2026-10-22T00:39:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1846651706687146","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Corn Duck. Things Are About to Pop.","summary":"I gave a rubber duck the power to make popcorn. This is what happened. Meet the Corn Duck, one of the special ducks in Mayhem Duck Simulator. It looks innocent enough in its little green husk, until it starts glowing and popcorn goes flying everywhere. The best part is watching the other ducks react while it carries on making an absolute mess. Here's a short clip of the ability in action: Would you let this one loose by the pool? If you'd like to meet the rest of the flock, add Mayhem Duck Simul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:51:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1846651706677848","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Clown Duck — Our Pool Has Become a Circus!","summary":"One clown duck. An entire pool of chaos. Meet the clown duck, one of the special ducks in Mayhem Duck Simulator!His trick? Blowing animal-shaped balloons from his mouth. The other ducks get so excited that they jump at the balloons. Naturally, things get out of hand.If you enjoyed this little circus, wishlist Mayhem Duck Simulator to be notified when the full game launches.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:02:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677848","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1842212951314571","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"announcement","title":"Paint and Customize Your Ducks!","summary":"Paint and Customize Your Ducks!Hello everyone!We are here with a new update. The Painting System, which allows you to personalize your ducks by painting them in any color you want, is now live!What's New?Create Your Own Style: Reflect your personal style in the game by painting the ducks exactly how you want them. The color choice is entirely yours!Your Designs Are Safe: All your paintings and customizations are now automatically saved. Your custom-painted ducks will be waiting for you every tim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T19:49:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314571","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1841579228677955","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"update","title":"Patch Update: Smoother Camera & Better Land Controls! 🦆","summary":"Quack! A new small update is now live. We've made some quality-of-life improvements to make controlling and watching your ducks much better.Patch Notes / Bug Fixes:Improved Land Movement: Fixed the issue where ducks were sliding excessively while on land. They will now stop exactly when intended and no longer lose their facing direction.Smoother Camera: Overhauled the camera system. Camera movements are now much smoother, providing a better and more comfortable viewing experience.Thank you for y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T10:51:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1841579228674213","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"update","title":"Stretch Your Beaks & Speak in Emojis: Update 1.6 is Live!","summary":"Update 1.6 is Live: Grappling Beaks, Emojis, and Story Time! 🦆We are thrilled to announce that Update 1.6 is finally here! We've added some wild new mechanics, better onboarding, and a bit of lore to spice up your plastic duck adventures.Here is everything new in this update:The \"Grappling Beak\" Mechanic: Plastic ducks have evolved! You can now launch and extend your duck's beak to latch onto any object in the world. Use it to stick to surfaces, swing around, or drag heavy items. Physics-based c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T23:18:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228674213","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1840310314353759","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"announcement","title":"The House is Yours: Wreak Total Havoc!","summary":"🦆 Update 1.5: Interior Mayhem & Duck Art is Live!Update v1.5 is officially here to expand the boundaries of chaos—allowing you to break into the house, shatter windows, and turn your duck tracks into masterpieces!Here is everything included in this update:🎨 Duck Canvas & Colorful TrailsLeave Your Mark: Moving around with your ducks now leaves colorful trails on the ground.Unleash Your Inner Artist: Each duck features its own unique color. Let's see who can draw the best picture! Be sure to share","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T10:51:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1840310314341244","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"update","title":"Fast, Furious & Plastic: Demo 1.4 Update","summary":"Plastic Ducks Went Crazy! Demo 1.4 Update is Now Live 🦆💨Hello everyone!Demo 1.4 is officially live! With this update, we've added brand new mechanics to our ducks, unleashed even more chaos, and skyrocketed the game's performance. Here is everything waiting for you in the new version:💥 Brand New Dash Mechanics & ChaosDash System: A brand new dash ability has been added to the ducks! Press Shift to instantly dash forward.Angry Ducks: Holding down Shift charges up your duck. Once it turns complete","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T08:54:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4912110-1839676055883146","game_id":"steam-4912110","kind":"announcement","title":"Shaped by Your Feedback: Smoother, Better, Quackier! 🛠️ Demo v1.3","summary":"Hello Duck Lovers! 🦆💥Thanks to your awesome feedback, Demo v1.3 is officially live on Steam! In this update, we’ve packed in fun new mechanics while polishing the overall controls and technical performance for a much smoother experience.Here is what's new in v1.3:✨ Custom Trail Effects for Every DuckEvery duck now has its own unique, custom-designed trail effect matching its personality! Leave your mark as you glide around.🎈 Deflate & Re-Inflate Mechanic (Ctrl Key) Is your duck losing air? Press","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T17:22:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4912110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4912110":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4912110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4948480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4912110","app_id":4912110,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cc9c8664e7b2e2f1528c54f89e3c012045a6219f123226533af3925740f84d51","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"고무 오리가 되어 누리는 자유를 만끽할 준비가 되셨나요? 🦆 《Mayhem Duck Simulator》는 힐링과 카오스가 공존하는 물리 기반의 플라스틱 오리 시뮬레이터입니다. 모든 오리를 조종하고, 특수 오리를 구출하며 수영장을 짜릿하게 뒤흔들어 보세요! 평화든 광기든, 이 수영장의 모든 것은 당신의 명령을 따릅니다! ✨🛸🔥","publishers":[{"name":"Glare Games","creator_clan_account_id":45903752}],"developers":[{"name":"Glare Games","creator_clan_account_id":45903752}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795543200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_nam